en:
//【本家】
<voice name='本家' class='本家' src='voice/md02/0450010b52'>
//『貴様が事の決着をつけよ』
"You must answer for his failure."

pt:
//【本家】
<voice name='本家' class='本家' src='voice/md02/0450010b52'>
//『貴様が事の決着をつけよ』
"Você há de responder pelo fracasso dele."

en:
//【本家】
<voice name='本家' class='本家' src='voice/md02/0450020b52'>
//『この能無し――明堯と湊斗家との縁を、
//　貴様の手で断ち切るのだ』
"This man is useless to us now. With your own hands, you will sever the last bond tying him to your family."

pt:
//【本家】
<voice name='本家' class='本家' src='voice/md02/0450020b52'>
//『この能無し――明堯と湊斗家との縁を、
//　貴様の手で断ち切るのだ』
"Este homem já não nos é útil. Com suas próprias mãos, você romperá o último laço que o prende à sua família."

en:
//【署長】
<voice name='署長' class='署長' src='voice/md02/0450030a11'>
//『……許せ。景明』
"...Forgive me, Kageaki..."

pt:
//【署長】
<voice name='署長' class='署長' src='voice/md02/0450030a11'>
//『……許せ。景明』
"...Perdoe-me, Kageaki..."

en:
//【本家】
<voice name='本家' class='本家' src='voice/md02/0450040b52'>
//『去れ、明堯。
//　今後二度と、湊斗を名乗ることも、儂の前
//に現れることも許さぬ』
"Away with you, Akitaka. The Minato name is no longer yours to bear. And if you know what is good for you, you will never again show your face in my presence."

pt:
//【本家】
<voice name='本家' class='本家' src='voice/md02/0450040b52'>
//『去れ、明堯。
//　今後二度と、湊斗を名乗ることも、儂の前
//に現れることも許さぬ』
"Retire-se, Akitaka. O nome Minato já não lhe pertence. E, se sabe o que lhe convém, nunca mais voltará a mostrar seu rosto diante de mim."

en:
//【署長】
<voice name='署長' class='署長' src='voice/md02/0450050a11'>
//『……景明……』
"...Kageaki..."

//【署長】
<voice name='署長' class='署長' src='voice/md02/0450060a11'>
//『湊斗の家を……
//　光のことを、頼む』
"Subaru... and Hikaru... I leave them to you."

pt:
//【署長】
<voice name='署長' class='署長' src='voice/md02/0450050a11'>
//『……景明……』
"...Kageaki..."

//【署長】
<voice name='署長' class='署長' src='voice/md02/0450060a11'>
//『湊斗の家を……
//　光のことを、頼む』
"Subaru... e Hikaru... Eu os confio a você."

en:
//【統】
<voice name='統' class='統' src='voice/md02/0450070b46'>
//「……光を頼むよ、景明。
//　約束……忘れないで」
"...Take care of Hikaru, Kageaki. Don't forget... your <I>promise.</I>"

pt:
//【統】
<voice name='統' class='統' src='voice/md02/0450070b46'>
//「……光を頼むよ、景明。
//　約束……忘れないで」
"...Cuide de Hikaru, Kageaki. Não se esqueça... da sua <I>promessa.</I>"
